1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,399
Is Ms. Lu back too?

17
00:00:55,159 --> 00:00:56,679
Did He Jingchen hurt her?

18
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,359
Answer me! Have you lost your tongue?

19
00:01:00,479 --> 00:01:02,079
Tell He Jingchen to come see me.

20
00:01:04,359 --> 00:01:05,280
Young Master Rong.

21
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:07,079
You can eat when you reach Lancheng.

22
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,120
What do you mean?

23
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:09,920
Let go of me!

24
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:10,599
Move.

25
00:01:10,599 --> 00:01:11,840
Where are you taking me?

26
00:01:12,079 --> 00:01:13,000
Where's Yutang?

27
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:13,920
I want to see Yutang!

28
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:16,880
=Episode 23=

29
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,200
You two

30
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:24,040
have long abused your ties
to the Lu clan.

31
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,319
You've withheld military pay

32
00:01:26,959 --> 00:01:28,480
and lined your own pockets.

33
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,799
But when the governor was in danger,

34
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,159
you withheld your troops
and refused to save him,

35
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:34,599
and plotted a rebellion to seize power.

36
00:01:34,799 --> 00:01:35,599
Today,

37
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,120
before the governor himself,

38
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:38,920
you'll face military justice

39
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,719
and be purged from the Lu Army.

40
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:42,799
Spare us!

41
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:44,400
Commander He, spare us!

42
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,359
Ms. Lu, spare us!

43
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,439
Commander He.

44
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,719
Quiet!

45
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,519
Ms. Lu has something to say.

46
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,439
As soldiers,

47
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,239
they're duty-bound to obey orders.

48
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:56,799
They're only rank-and-file soldiers.

49
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,920
They served under Yang and Qin,

50
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:02,159
so obeying their orders was expected.

51
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,000
That doesn't make them disloyal.

52
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,239
Commander He, Staff Officer Chen.

53
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,760
In my opinion,

54
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:10,120
give them a chance to make amends

55
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,240
through military service.

56
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:12,540
♪Trying to make the act seem profound♪

57
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:14,240
You two are indeed perceptive.

58
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:15,479
Given some time,

59
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,400
you'll see who is truly loyal

60
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:19,919
and who harbors treachery.

61
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:22,280
Then deal with them accordingly.

62
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,800
That's better than condemning them all

63
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:24,840
and killing loyal men by mistake.

64
00:02:24,940 --> 00:02:26,440
♪Pretense puts on a show♪

65
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:27,540
♪Indulgence joins the game♪

66
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,759
Since Ms. Lu has pleaded for you,

67
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:32,280
I'll give you a chance to make amends.

68
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:33,919
Commander He, you're wise and just.

69
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:35,719
Thank you for saving us, Ms. Lu.

70
00:02:36,039 --> 00:02:37,840
(Yang and Qin deserve to die.)

71
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,639
(But their soldiers can still be saved.)

72
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,719
(When military justice is carried out,)

73
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:42,919
(I'll play the villain.)

74
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:44,159
(You play the merciful one.)

75
00:02:44,599 --> 00:02:45,919
(That way,)

76
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:47,719
(the soldiers will owe you a favor.)

77
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:49,599
But as for Yang and Qin,

78
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:51,719
their crimes warrant death.

79
00:02:52,879 --> 00:02:54,439
Commander He, spare us!

80
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:56,180
♪I know it all too well♪

81
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,400
I don't want to die!

82
00:02:58,039 --> 00:02:58,840
I know I was wrong!

83
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:00,560
♪Sentiment keeps tripping me up♪

84
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:02,280
Spare me, Commander He!

85
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,720
♪Moments of clarity calm it all♪

86
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,000
Thank you, Commander He.

87
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,080
You helped me secure my position
in the Chamber

88
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:10,840
and win over the army.

89
00:03:11,319 --> 00:03:12,560
I'm not doing it for free.

90
00:03:13,039 --> 00:03:14,080
I have a condition.

91
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:16,439
Spare us!

92
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:20,520
♪My fervent gaze sings your praises♪

93
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:25,840
♪That familiar wicked streak♪

94
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:27,080
♪Parting and reunion pull me apart♪

95
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,199
What's gotten into Zhaolin?

96
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,280
Seven years ago,

97
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:34,280
Yang and Qin sexually assaulted
Zhaolin's sister-in-law.

98
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,800
His brother was furious

99
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:37,560
and reported them to the governor.

100
00:03:37,639 --> 00:03:38,599
He never returned home.

101
00:03:38,599 --> 00:03:39,759
His sister-in-law waited in vain

102
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,400
and hanged herself at home.

103
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,879
Zhaolin lost both his parents as a child

104
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,599
and was raised by his brother
and sister-in-law.

105
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:47,960
He may seem carefree,

106
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,879
but he's just like me.

107
00:03:50,319 --> 00:03:51,120
We've both endured

108
00:03:51,599 --> 00:03:52,400
and bided our time.

109
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:56,759
I spared those two until now

110
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,479
for this very day,

111
00:03:58,639 --> 00:04:00,240
so you could execute them yourself.

112
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,960
Commander He.

113
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:05,639
My life is yours from now on.

114
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:11,520
♪That familiar wicked streak♪

115
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,360
(Fancheng Railway Station)
Yutang!

116
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:17,560
Yutang!

117
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:19,920
Yutang!

118
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:21,639
Yutang!

119
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:23,920
Are you all right?

120
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:25,360
Did He Jingchen hurt you?

121
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,079
Young Master Rong.

122
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:30,920
I'm sorry.

123
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:33,959
It's time I told you the truth.

124
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,279
Yutang.

125
00:04:35,759 --> 00:04:36,439
Yutang.

126
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,920
Why do you look so troubled?

127
00:04:41,279 --> 00:04:42,680
What exactly happened?

128
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,120
I told you,

129
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:46,680
no matter what he did to you,

130
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,680
I won't mind.

131
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,519
You're still my fiancee.

132
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,120
Not anymore.

133
00:04:58,439 --> 00:04:59,800
This letter ends our engagement.

134
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:00,839
Take it

135
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:02,560
and go back to Lancheng.

136
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,560
Find someone who's truly right for you.

137
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:06,959
Why end our engagement?

138
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,560
He forced you,

139
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,279
didn't he?

140
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,199
He Jingchen!

141
00:05:22,759 --> 00:05:24,079
You tried to kill the governor,

142
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:26,360
then took Yutang hostage
to seize power in a rebellion.

143
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:28,199
Now you want
to seize the Governor's Residence too!

144
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:30,480
I'll tell the Lu clan what you've done!

145
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:32,519
Go ahead,

146
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,639
if you ever get to see them again.

147
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:36,079
Young Master Rong.

148
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,360
It's not as simple as you think.

149
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:40,240
None of this in Fancheng concerns you.

150
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,639
Getting involved won't do you any good.

151
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:42,560
Trust me.

152
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:43,920
No.

153
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:46,160
How could I leave you here alone?

154
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,160
Holding hands again.

155
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,199
I told you.

156
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:51,000
I only want
to spend the rest of my life with you.

157
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,000
It was fake.

158
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,199
All of it was fake, Rong Muxian.

159
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,959
I never had feelings for you.

160
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:58,639
Our relationship
was fake from the start.

161
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,120
I'm sorry.

162
00:06:10,959 --> 00:06:12,199
He forced you, didn't he?

163
00:06:14,399 --> 00:06:16,439
He's threatening you with my life,
isn't he?

164
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,439
I understand now.

165
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,800
If you don't obey him,

166
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,879
he'll kill me.

167
00:06:22,759 --> 00:06:23,560
Yutang.

168
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,839
You're doing what he says

169
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:27,360
so I can make it back
to Lancheng alive, right?

170
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,319
Yutang.

171
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:36,120
Don't be afraid.

172
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,600
I'll come back and save you.

173
00:06:38,079 --> 00:06:38,879
Yutang!

174
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,439
Yutang, I promise I'll come back
and save you!

175
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,759
You don't have to work so hard.

176
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,600
The Chamber is already yours.

177
00:07:04,319 --> 00:07:06,160
Those books will still be here later.

178
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,279
A short break won't hurt.

179
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:12,199
We've been through so much together.

180
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,879
Now that we're finally back,

181
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:17,319
we should get some proper rest.

182
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,360
If you're tired, Commander He,

183
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,959
you can go rest.

184
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:30,199
You don't have to stay with me.

185
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,839
You mean

186
00:07:35,279 --> 00:07:36,480
we're sleeping separately?

187
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:37,700
Mm-hmm.

188
00:07:38,439 --> 00:07:39,240
What else?

189
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,160
I got used to having you beside me
in the mountains.

190
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:51,040
I'm afraid I can't sleep alone now.

191
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,439
Commander He, you really are something.

192
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,680
You can say something so shameless

193
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,319
and still make it sound so righteous.

194
00:08:01,399 --> 00:08:02,639
Shameless?

195
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:03,120
Mm-hmm.

196
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:06,720
I don't think so.

197
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,519
There's something
I've always wanted to ask you.

198
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:44,800
Hmm?

199
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,360
When exactly
did you fall in love with me?

200
00:08:52,559 --> 00:08:53,360
I don't know.

201
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,840
How can you not know?

202
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:09,679
But I do know

203
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:12,600
when I realized I loved you.

204
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:14,200
Hmph.

205
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,159
You just love being mysterious.

206
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,320
What about you?

207
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,639
When did you fall for me?

208
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,799
Of course I'm not telling you.

209
00:09:41,279 --> 00:09:44,559
Then I'll assume
you fell for me at first sight.

210
00:09:44,919 --> 00:09:46,000
How could that be possible?

211
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,759
You had a gun pointed at my head.

212
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,039
That day,

213
00:09:54,879 --> 00:09:56,480
the Second Concubine's daughter
was killed.

214
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,919
I was a mess.

215
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:03,000
Do you know why, all these years,

216
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:04,600
only the Second Concubine
and her daughter

217
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:07,200
ever managed to escape from Lu Zhentian?

218
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:15,639
My mother gave her life
to cover their escape.

219
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,240
Because of that,

220
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:21,360
Lu Zhentian shot my mother dead.

221
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:23,080
That year,

222
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,039
I was only four.

223
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,240
I swore

224
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:30,639
I'd kill Lu Zhentian
and avenge my mother.

225
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:34,320
But Staff Officer Chen,
who raised me in secret, told me

226
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:37,440
the Lu family had a treasure map

227
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:39,440
leading to countless gold bars.

228
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,679
In good hands,

229
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:45,360
they could bring Fancheng
peace and prosperity.

230
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,080
In the wrong hands,

231
00:10:48,039 --> 00:10:49,000
the people would suffer.

232
00:10:50,879 --> 00:10:54,480
So my goal became
getting the treasure map first,

233
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:56,600
then killing Lu Zhentian.

234
00:10:57,279 --> 00:10:58,519
When I was twelve,

235
00:10:59,799 --> 00:11:01,200
I returned to the Governor's Residence

236
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:04,240
as Lu Shaoyun's study companion.

237
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,279
Little by little,

238
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:11,320
I fed his desire to rebel.

239
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:13,200
But he proved useless.

240
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:18,200
Then Lu Zhentian began searching

241
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,679
for the daughter
the Second Concubine left behind.

242
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,440
You know the rest.

243
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,440
Do you know

244
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:33,080
why I didn't come see you
that night in the woodshed?

245
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:38,720
I stole steamed buns for you,

246
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:42,240
and the matron at Yingchun Brothel
whipped me for it.

247
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:46,720
My master and Kefu happened
to pass by and see me.

248
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:49,879
Kefu used her mother's bracelet

249
00:11:49,879 --> 00:11:51,080
to buy my freedom.

250
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,720
Thanks to them,

251
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,960
I escaped a life in the brothel.

252
00:11:57,159 --> 00:11:57,960
The bracelet?

253
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:03,159
Later, once I'd saved enough money,

254
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:05,240
I found the matron from back then

255
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:07,039
and bought the bracelet back,

256
00:12:07,039 --> 00:12:08,120
planning to return it to Kefu.

257
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,799
That was the very day

258
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:19,200
Lu Shaoyun killed Kefu.

259
00:12:24,519 --> 00:12:25,840
This bracelet belonged to my mother.

260
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,919
Back then,

261
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,879
when she and the Second Concubine
parted,

262
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,720
they exchanged keepsakes.

263
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:35,080
The Second Concubine gave her that ring.

264
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,240
The ring?

265
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,799
The one you left me back then?

266
00:12:49,279 --> 00:12:51,200
The Second Concubine and her daughter

267
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,519
gained their freedom
at the cost of my mother's life.

268
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,879
I couldn't save Lin Kefu.

269
00:12:58,639 --> 00:12:59,919
When I see my mother in the afterlife,

270
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,960
I don't know how I'll face her.

271
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,519
Don't think like that.

272
00:13:06,559 --> 00:13:08,200
Your mother would understand.

273
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,840
Kefu and her mother would too.

274
00:13:14,879 --> 00:13:16,200
And so do I.

275
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:45,080
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

276
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:49,720
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

277
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:52,880
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

278
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:55,400
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

